<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div id="main" tabindex="-1"><div aria-labelledby="_R_35fiv63qivb_"><p></p><h2 id="_R_35fiv63qivb_">The full-stack creative canvas</h2><p></p></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_l5fiv63qivb_"><div><h2 id="_R_l5fiv63qivb_">Move fast in the right direction on an AI-native canvas. </h2><p><span>Teammates and AI agents work in the same space with shared context. Generate new ideas, refine, and align—together.</span></p></div><ul role="list"><li><article aria-labelledby="_R_9lakl5fiv63qivb_"></article></li><li><article aria-labelledby="_R_alakl5fiv63qivb_"><div><p>Your built-in creative collaborator</p><p><span>Ask Figma’s agent to add motion to designs, document your design systems, implement feedback, and more.</span></p></div></article></li></ul></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_155fiv63qivb_"><div><h2 id="_R_155fiv63qivb_">One workspace for your entire product development process. </h2><p><span>Made so your whole team can go from WIP to ship, together.</span></p></div><div><ul role="list"><li><article aria-labelledby="_R_6lal55fiv63qivb_"><div><h3 id="_R_6lal55fiv63qivb_">Design anything you can imagine </h3><p><span>Turn your ideas into apps, websites, and products.</span></p></div></article></li><li><article aria-labelledby="_R_alal55fiv63qivb_"><div><h3 id="_R_alal55fiv63qivb_">Build with intention </h3><p><span>Dev tools that take you all the way to production.</span></p></div></article></li></ul></div></div><section aria-labelledby="_R_1l5fiv63qivb_"><div><h2 id="_R_1l5fiv63qivb_">Powerfully expressive. Incredibly precise. </h2><p><span>Every technical tool you need to dial in the details.</span></p></div><ul role="list"><li><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="A mock website showing Texture values" width="656" height="816" data-lqip="true"><img data-loading="true" width="656" height="816" loading="lazy" alt="A mock website showing Texture values" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/b82592e52a6cc84b26ac68a8fd0fd5f2d05e0a34-656x816.png?w=656&amp;h=816&amp;q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/b82592e52a6cc84b26ac68a8fd0fd5f2d05e0a34-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.5 328w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/b82592e52a6cc84b26ac68a8fd0fd5f2d05e0a34-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.75 492w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/b82592e52a6cc84b26ac68a8fd0fd5f2d05e0a34-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=2 656w"></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="UI showing different brush stokes that can be applied to type" width="656" height="816" data-lqip="true"><img data-loading="true" width="656" height="816" loading="lazy" alt="UI showing different brush stokes that can be applied to type" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/a92909334c175cb8deb08724809a6a133a2fdaee-656x816.png?w=656&amp;h=816&amp;q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/a92909334c175cb8deb08724809a6a133a2fdaee-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.5 328w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/a92909334c175cb8deb08724809a6a133a2fdaee-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.75 492w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/a92909334c175cb8deb08724809a6a133a2fdaee-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=2 656w"></li><li><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="A cursor vector editing a design" width="656" height="816" data-lqip="true"><img data-loading="true" width="656" height="816" loading="lazy" alt="A cursor vector editing a design" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/93c59de7e67fe357465b8ec359399d7afb637499-656x816.png?w=656&amp;h=816&amp;q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/93c59de7e67fe357465b8ec359399d7afb637499-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.5 328w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/93c59de7e67fe357465b8ec359399d7afb637499-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.75 492w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/93c59de7e67fe357465b8ec359399d7afb637499-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=2 656w"></li><li></li><li><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Type on a path shown in purple and teal against a pink background" width="656" height="816" data-lqip="true"><img data-loading="true" width="656" height="816" loading="lazy" alt="Type on a path shown in purple and teal against a pink background" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/a43092a3987b43555ead7b8bba779647c4f28fc1-656x816.png?w=656&amp;h=816&amp;q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/a43092a3987b43555ead7b8bba779647c4f28fc1-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.5 328w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/a43092a3987b43555ead7b8bba779647c4f28fc1-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.75 492w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/a43092a3987b43555ead7b8bba779647c4f28fc1-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=2 656w"></li><li></li><li><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="A prompt node and a pre-selected image node connect to create the visual output of a butterfly on the Figma Weave interface" width="656" height="816" data-lqip="true"><img data-loading="true" width="656" height="816" loading="lazy" alt="A prompt node and a pre-selected image node connect to create the visual output of a butterfly on the Figma Weave interface" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/b87135e6a9c3ac94f0a433889659b3434086682e-656x816.png?w=656&amp;h=816&amp;q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/b87135e6a9c3ac94f0a433889659b3434086682e-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.5 328w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/b87135e6a9c3ac94f0a433889659b3434086682e-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.75 492w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/b87135e6a9c3ac94f0a433889659b3434086682e-656x816.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=2 656w"></li><li></li><li><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="UI over a butterfly bitmap mosaic with optionality to change the spacing and establish minimum and maximum sizes" width="992" height="1232" data-lqip="true"><img data-loading="true" width="992" height="1232" loading="lazy" alt="UI over a butterfly bitmap mosaic with optionality to change the spacing and establish minimum and maximum sizes" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/55e1130298788b5d059c311fcc01437142024bd5-992x1232.png?w=992&amp;h=1232&amp;q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/55e1130298788b5d059c311fcc01437142024bd5-992x1232.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.5 496w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/55e1130298788b5d059c311fcc01437142024bd5-992x1232.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.75 744w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/55e1130298788b5d059c311fcc01437142024bd5-992x1232.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=2 992w"></li></ul></section><div aria-labelledby="_R_255fiv63qivb_"><h2 id="_R_255fiv63qivb_">Start with design context. Build with consistency. </h2><p><span>Your context, codebase, and agents stay connected so what you design is what gets shipped.</span></p></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_2l5fiv63qivb_"><div><p></p><h2 id="_R_2l5fiv63qivb_">The products you love are designed in Figma </h2><p></p></div><div><figure><blockquote><p>Everyone is able to influence, inspire, and give input without ever leaving the design file. That creates a really transparent, open, and honest process throughout the whole project.</p></blockquote><div><figcaption><div><p><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="headshot of Francisco" width="48" height="48" data-lqip="true"></p></div><div><p><cite><span>Francisco Seiz</span></cite></p><p>Senior Design Director, Code and Theory</p></div></figcaption></div></figure><div><ul role="list"><li><span><span><span>95%</span></span></span><div><p>95% of the Fortune 500 uses Figma</p></div></li></ul><div><p>Based on data from March 2025.</p></div></div></div></div><div aria-labelledby="_r_1_"><p></p><h2 id="_r_1_">Ideas no longer have to wait their turn</h2><p></p></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_p5fiv63qivb_"><div><h2 id="_R_p5fiv63qivb_">Explore what you can do in Figma. </h2><p><span>Browse resources made by the community.</span></p></div><div role="group" aria-label="Explore what you can do in Figma." aria-describedby="_R_alp5fiv63qivbH1_" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-live="polite" id="_R_alp5fiv63qivb_"><div><p><span><span id="_R_alp5fiv63qivbH1_" role="status" aria-live="polite">Slide 1 of 10</span></span></p></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="slide 1" aria-hidden="false"><article aria-labelledby="_R_8daqlp5fiv63qivb_"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Components for chips, cards, tiles, and checkboxes" width="984" height="1476" data-lqip="true"><img data-loading="true" width="984" height="1476" loading="lazy" alt="Components for chips, cards, tiles, and checkboxes" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/49adaf90dfa6810bb58849391baa1c63997c205c-984x1476.png?w=984&amp;h=1476&amp;q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/49adaf90dfa6810bb58849391baa1c63997c205c-984x1476.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.5 492w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/49adaf90dfa6810bb58849391baa1c63997c205c-984x1476.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=0.75 738w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/599r6htc/regionalized/49adaf90dfa6810bb58849391baa1c63997c205c-984x1476.png?q=75&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=2 984w"><div><p></p><h2 id="_R_8daqlp5fiv63qivb_">UI kits </h2><p></p></div></article></div></div></div></div></div>